]])\n- **Immune Support:** Preventing illness and supporting immune function during periods of intensified training or competition ([[A38. Immune System Adaptations to Training]], [[C6. Micronutrients (Detailed Roles & Considerations)]])\n\n**Links:** [[A6. Energy Systems (Detailed)]], [[A38. Immune System Adaptations to Training]], [[C6. Micronutrients (Detailed Roles & Considerations)]], [[C27. Nutrition for Endurance Performance (Carb Loading)]], [[C29. Nutrition for Recovery]], [[C32. Gut Health and Microbiome]], [[C33. Anti-Inflammatory FoodsDiets]], [[C34. Antioxidants]], [[C44. Competition Day Nutrition]], [[M1. Recovery Modalities Evidence and Application]]'}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a fitness science expert helping to improve the accessibility and clarity of exercise science notes while maintaining scientific accuracy.', 'temperature': 0.7}}
