ct environmental stressors and accelerate adaptation processes ([[C29. Nutrition for Recovery]], [[M1. Recovery Modalities Evidence and Application]])\n- **Performance Maintenance:** Ensuring optimal nutrient availability and metabolic function across diverse environmental challenges while maintaining competitive performance standards ([[F2. Performance Optimization Factors]], [[C35. Specialized Nutrition for Performance Demands]])\n\n**Links:** [[C2. Macronutrient Distribution]], [[C3. Nutrient Timing]], [[C29. Nutrition for Recovery]], [[C34. Antioxidants]], [[C35. Specialized Nutrition for Performance Demands]], [[C46. Altitude Nutrition]], [[C47. Heat Stress Nutrition]], [[C48. Cold Weather Nutrition]], [[F2. Performance Optimization Factors]], [[M1. Recovery Modalities Evidence and Application]], [[M3. Stress Management and Performance]]'}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a fitness science expert helping to improve the accessibility and clarity of exercise science notes while maintaining scientific accuracy.', 'temperature': 0.7}}
