oad metrics and recovery indicators\n\n**Links:** [[A25. Principle of Periodization]], [[A48. Training Load Monitoring]], [[A49. Recovery Monitoring and Assessment]], [[C3. Nutrient Timing]], [[C25. Nutrition for Muscle Gain (Hypertrophy)]], [[C27. Nutrition for Endurance Performance (Carb Loading)]], [[C29. Nutrition for Recovery]], [[C53. Periodized Nutrition]], [[C54. Precision Nutrition Monitoring]], [[C55. Nutrient-Exercise Interaction]], [[O1. Integrated Programming Considerations]], [[O3. Integrating Nutrition and Training]]'}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a fitness science expert helping to improve the accessibility and clarity of exercise science notes while maintaining scientific accuracy.', 'temperature': 0.7}}
