. Balance and Coordination Training]], [[L4. Core Stability Training]], [[IX-2. Injury Prevention Strategies]]'}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a fitness science expert helping to improve the accessibility and clarity of exercise science notes while maintaining scientific accuracy.', 'temperature': 0.7}}
