ries & Rehabilitation]], [[IX-5. Introduction to Rehabilitation Principles]], [[M1. Recovery Modalities Evidence and Application]], [[VIII. Fitness Equipment & Technology]]'}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a fitness science expert helping to improve the accessibility and clarity of exercise science notes while maintaining scientific accuracy.', 'temperature': 0.7}}
